                                                "sense_id": "baaba497-e33c-3220-93c6-0eb020bc9343",
                                                "text": "This isn't just technostalgia or a diatribe against what Nicholas Negroponte calls \"digital obesity.\" The upbeat message is that the search for simplicity is a golden opportunity for IS managers."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "35f28971-eefb-4e0e-b208-37e778049817",
                                                "sense_id": "baaba497-e33c-3220-93c6-0eb020bc9343",
                                                "text": "Technostalgia is about the ways in which, in the past, the future was imagined."
